<title>HONG KONG: Vincent says interim loss at HK$3.71 mln.</title>
<headline>Vincent says interim loss at HK$3.71 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.79 loss   vs 1.96 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.66 profit vs 0.17 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    3.71 loss   vs 3.90 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     197.86	vs 315.30</p>
<p>    Company name		 Vincent Intertrans (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Vincent Intertrans is a freight forwarder. Exceptional gain represents gain on sale of land and building.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
